clicking a system, displaying the extra columns from their original Excel file (Domain, Data Sharing, Scope).\n  - Explicitly requested the complete deletion of the \"Dashboard\" feature: \"xóa luôn này và xóa cái trang dashboard đi\".\n- **Infrastructure:**\n  - GitHub repository: `https://github.com/Ln0og/123.git` (The codebase is currently tracked here; local Git user is set to `Lnog` / `lnog@example.com`).\n- **Assets:**\n  - Requested a downloadable blank template for \"Mẫu 03\" to distribute to departments for data entry.\n\n## 3. Work Accomplished\n- **Dashboard Feature Removed:** Completely deleted the `src/app/dashboard` and `src/app/api/dashboard` directories. Removed all navigation links to it from `admin/layout.tsx`, `(portal)/layout.tsx`, and `page.tsx`. Changed the `/admin` root redirect to point to `/admin/he-thong`.\n- **\"Hiện trạng\" Detailed Popup Implemented:** Upgraded `src/app/(portal)/kts/hien-trang/page.tsx` with an Ant Design `Modal`. It now parses the `moTa` field (which contains squished Excel columns) and beautifully presents \"Tên miền\", \"Dữ liệu chia sẻ\", and \"Phạm vi\" in a `Descriptions` table.\n- **Literal `\\n` Bug Fixed:** Fixed a bug where literal `\\n` strings in the SQLite database fused URLs with description text in the popup by updating the parsing logic to use regex `.split(/\\\\n|\\n/)`.\n- **Next.js Dev Overlay Hidden:** Injected a brute-force CSS hack into `src/app/globals.css` (`nextjs-portal, #__next-build-watcher { display: none !important; }`) to definitively hide the stubborn Turbopack dev indicator.\n- **\"Mẫu 03\" Excel Template Generated:** Wrote a Node script (`generate_template.js`) to generate a blank `public/Mau_03_KhaiBao.xlsx` template and added a \"Tải File Mẫu\" download button to `src/app/admin/import/page.tsx`.\n- **Admin CRUD Finalized:** Resolved all lingering ESLint React Hooks warnings (`Avoid calling setState() directly within an effect`) in `he-thong` and `nhiem-vu` pages by removing synchronous